    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i> </p><p>A Smoke Grenade produces a cloud obscuring fog that blocks sight. Smoke Grenades come in a variety of colors, making them useful as a signaling method to mark aerial attacks or call for evacuation. </p><p>Smoke Grenades fill a 2-Square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius with thick smoke that provides <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Concealment\" title=\"Concealment\">Concealment</a> and creates a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Smoke\" title=\"Smoke\">Smoke</a> Hazard within the area. This cloud lasts for 10 rounds. </p><p><b>Special:</b>&nbsp;This is an&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a>&nbsp;Weapon. </p>",
